# Murogi Trading Bot

Deploy to Render:
[![Deploy to Render](https://render.com/images/deploy-to-render-button.svg)](https://render.com/deploy)

## Setup:
1. Fork this repo
2. Click "Deploy to Render" above
3. Connect GitHub
4. Set env: `none`
5. Start command: `gunicorn app:app`

## Features:
- Deriv OAuth login
- Shows balance
- Affiliate: KA5MGSJVX3X7
